      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Hey, I heard they got nice cars up in Heaven",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Free liquor out the bar and the brightest fuckin' stars up in Heaven",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Heard that you can chill, not worry 'bout the police",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Not worry 'bout someone fightin' 'cause everything just at peace",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Heard the streets paved with gold, the women all gorgeous",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"You just float, can't even feel where the floor is",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I heard Heaven got a brand new venue",
          "rhyme":"y",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Next to that restaurant, you love their menu",
          "rhyme":"y",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"And everything free, so everyone cool",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Look out any window, it's an incredible view",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Everyone you speak to always tellin' you the truth",
          "rhyme":"yt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"And it's only good shit when you gettin' all your news",
          "rhyme":"uz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Ooh, I imagine that",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Just a place that we can kick it, be happy at",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Satisfaction or maybe I'm dreamin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Tell you what it's like when I see it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
