        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Never a fuckin' rush, you there for a million plus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"You probably got a Mercedes, but always could take the bus",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"So fuck, that's what Heaven's like, I guess I think it is",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"But come to think of it, I've been drinkin', shit, I don't know the truth",
          "rhyme":"yt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
